Audio Duration: 1m 52.9s (112.90s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:08:22 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 9  | Text: 为什么不要脸的人反而混得好
Segment #2   [00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,660] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为这个世界本质就是奖励赶伸手的人
Segment #3   [00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,880] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 10 | Text: 你那些所谓的尊严面子
Segment #4   [00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:08,940] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 10 | Text: 不好意思在生存面前一文不知
Segment #5   [00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,260] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 12 | Text: 你仔细观察就会发现一个规律
Segment #6   [00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,980] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 13 | Text: 真正赚到钱的人没有一个是脸皮薄的
Segment #7   [00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,120] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 那些规规矩矩
Segment #8   [00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:16,020] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 不好意思贪钱
Segment #9   [00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:16,960] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 不好意思争取
Segment #10  [00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:20,040] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 13 | Text: 不好意思拒绝的人一辈子都在底层挣扎
Segment #11  [00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,260] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 12 | Text: 而那些你瞧不上的后脸皮的人
Segment #12  [00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,460] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 一个个都过得比你好
Segment #13  [00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:23,940] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 1  | Text: 为什么
Segment #14  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,300] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 因为你在等别人傻
Segment #15  [00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,340] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 他在自己拿
Segment #16  [00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,440] | Elapsed:  14.57s | Words: 9  | Text: 你不好意思跟领导谈一次工资
Segment #17  [00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,120] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 你可能三年都涨不了五百块
Segment #18  [00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,600] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不好意思跟客户抱一次价
Segment #19  [00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,460] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 你可能丢掉一个十万的单子
Segment #20  [00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,420] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 11 | Text: 你不好意思拒绝同时甩过来的活
Segment #21  [00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:36,940] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 你可能每天多加班两小时
Segment #22  [00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,660] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么都得不到
Segment #23  [00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,880] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 12 | Text: 一次不好意思准失的可能是你整年的收入
Segment #24  [00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,320] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 而他他敢开价敢争取
Segment #25  [00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,100] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 敢被拒绝
Segment #26  [00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,400] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 被拒绝一百次
Segment #27  [00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,100] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 他还敢打第一百零一个电话
Segment #28  [00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,880] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 最后那个单子是他的
Segment #29  [00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:49,980] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 那个职位是他的
Segment #30  [00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,120] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 那个机会也是他的
Segment #31  [00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,560] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 你以为你在维护尊严
Segment #32  [00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:54,120] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 本质上你就是在害怕
Segment #33  [00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,040] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 你怕被拒绝
Segment #34  [00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,840] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 怕被笑话
Segment #35  [00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:56,920] | Elapsed:  32.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 怕别人说你功力
Segment #36  [00:00:56,920 --> 00:00:57,900] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 但我告诉你
Segment #37  [00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,900] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 没有人会因为你脸皮薄就高看你
Segment #38  [00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:01,700] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 这个社会只看结果
Segment #39  [00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:03,100] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 你有钱你说什么都对
Segment #40  [00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:05,340] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 12 | Text: 你没钱你在体面也没人尊重你
Segment #41  [00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,200] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 你就记住了
Segment #42  [00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,420] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 在你没成功之前
Segment #43  [00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:10,080] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 14 | Text: 你的面子是这个世界上最不值钱的东西
Segment #44  [00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,080] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 你穷的时候你在金磁
Segment #45  [00:01:12,080 --> 00:01:13,580] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 别人也只会觉得你无能
Segment #46  [00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:15,220] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 你失败的时候你在清高
Segment #47  [00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:16,620] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 别人也只会觉得你嘴硬
Segment #48  [00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:18,100] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 而那个不要脸的人
Segment #49  [00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:19,820] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 他低过头他陪过笑
Segment #50  [00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:21,600] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 他被人拒绝过一百次
Segment #51  [00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,800] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 他被人骂过后脸皮
Segment #52  [00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,160] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 但他赚到了钱买了房
Segment #53  [00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,020] | Elapsed:  49.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 赚到了高处
Segment #54  [00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,060] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 10 | Text: 这时候所有人都转过头来说
Segment #55  [00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,960] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 他真有本事
Segment #56  [00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,460] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看脸这个东西
Segment #57  [00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:30,700] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 6  | Text: 成功之前是负担
Segment #58  [00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:31,940] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 7  | Text: 成功之后是勋章
Segment #59  [00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,080] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 就这么简单
Segment #60  [00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,120] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 8  | Text: 我不是让你去当坏人
Segment #61  [00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,540] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 8  | Text: 不是让你去坑蒙拐骗
Segment #62  [00:01:35,540 --> 00:01:37,660] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 14 | Text: 我是让你把那个没用的面子包覆扔了
Segment #63  [00:01:37,660 --> 00:01:38,780] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 贪钱不要不好意思
Segment #64  [00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:39,940] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 争取不要不好意思
Segment #65  [00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:40,980] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 拒绝不要不好意思
Segment #66  [00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:43,400] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 13 | Text: 你连自己的利益都不敢伸手去拿
Segment #67  [00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,980] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 8  | Text: 你指望谁来可怜你
Segment #68  [00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,480] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 9  | Text: 等你有一天站到高处了
Segment #69  [00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,980] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 9  | Text: 你当年丢过的那些脸
Segment #70  [00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:49,640] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 10 | Text: 全都会被人说成格局大
Segment #71  [00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:50,560] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 能屈能伸
Segment #72  [00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,720] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #73  [00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,720] | Elapsed:  68.31s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
